┌─ gdoc v2.9.0 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 18 commands ─┐
│ Usage  gdoc <command> [words] [flags]                                                            │
│ ▸ gdoc v2.10.0 is published and this is v2.9.0. gdoc update installs it.                         │
├─ Read ─────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ read               │ Print the document as text, with the ids a comment or a suggestion is named │
│                    │ by.                                                                         │
│ comments           │ List the comment threads with their ranges, their replies and the next      │
│                    │ cursor.                                                                     │
│ suggestions        │ List the suggestions pending in the document.                               │
│ export             │ Write the document into the hub as Markdown, one file per tab, with its     │
│                    │ pictures beside it.                                                         │
├─ Write into a doc ─┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ restyle            │ Survey a document against the house style, or apply that style where the    │
│                    │ document stands.                                                            │
│ reply              │ Write one reply into a comment thread, under the robot prefix.              │
│ propose            │ Propose changes as native suggestions, each with the comment that says why. │
│ withdraw           │ Take back one pending suggestion, and only one gdoc proposed itself.        │
│ annotate           │ Leave a comment on the exact words you quote, under the robot prefix,       │
│                    │ changing nothing.                                                           │
├─ Make a doc ───────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ build              │ Build the note as a house-style docx on this machine, with no network at    │
│                    │ all.                                                                        │
│ publish            │ Build the note as a house-style document and upload it into one folder.     │
├─ Account and tool ─┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ auth status        │ Say whether gdoc has a token, when it expires, and what it may reach.       │
│ auth login         │ Print the Google sign-in URL and wait for the browser to come back.         │
│ probe              │ Create a throwaway document and say whether Docs honours a suggestion       │
│                    │ today.                                                                      │
│ update             │ Replace this gdoc with the newest release, or say what one would take.      │
│ mcp                │ Serve gdoc to Claude Desktop over stdin and stdout, as a protocol session   │
│                    │ rather than one object.                                                     │
│ help               │ Print every command gdoc takes, or the words and flags of one.              │
│ completion         │ Write the completion script for one shell, and say the line that turns it   │
│                    │ on.                                                                         │
└────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
Run gdoc help <command> for the words and flags one takes.
Add --json to print the JSON object a skill reads.
